    "description": "The brain: a curated, bounded model of the project kept from what reality produces. After every merge a script collects the signals (coder notes, review, verification, diff, scorecard) and rebuilds the component map; a curator (a one-shot model call, or a headless agent in curate mode, chosen by config.brainAgent) answers a contract: facts to add and retire, the plan, decisions to propose, questions for the person; a script applies it deterministically. Every brief reads the brain.",
